  "description": "With colors that reflect the brand’s performance heritage and glorious successes, combined with a design at the forefront of modern-day technology, the 795 BLADE RS ICONIC EDITION brings together the history, expertise and future of LOOK Cycle in a unique, ultra-high performance frameset. Poised to win on the UCI WORLD TOUR under the guidance of the Cofidis Team riders, this bike marks our comeback at the very highest level of cycling with style and character. Light, aerodynamic and stiff, it is the result of meticulous development to find the perfect carbon layup and geometry to cross the line first, no matter the race profile or location. The 795 BLADE RS ICONIC EDITION frameset brings you the unique riding feel that only a pure racing machine can, and is the perfect base to build the bike of your dreams.",
